# Core private data (a settings object the application can use as scratch/global storage):
# "set" REPLACES the whole content (previous keys disappear), "apply" MERGES the given values over
# the stored ones; "get" returns the current value (empty string for a missing key).
startup en-US -
private_data get k
private_data set k v1
private_data get k
private_data apply k2 v2
private_data get k
private_data get k2
private_data set k3 v3
private_data get k
private_data get k2
private_data get k3
shutdown
